@guide H_Feralas
@name Feralas (Camp Mojache)
@faction Horde
@levels 43-47
@zone Feralas
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Camp Mojache: the Woodpaw gnolls and the Zukk'ash hive to the south-east, the Grimtotem and the Gordunni ogres to the north, then the yetis, the Gordunni camp, the Twin Colossals giants and the Northspring harpies to the west.
@next H_Hinterlands

fp Camp Mojache
bind Camp Mojache [area=1099]
accept War on the Woodpaw | Hadoken Swiftstrider, Camp Mojache.
accept A New Cloak's Sheen | Krueg Skullsplitter.
accept 2975 The Ogres of Feralas | Rok Orhan.
accept The Mark of Quality | Jangdor Swiftstrider.
complete War on the Woodpaw | Woodpaw Gnoll Manes from the gnolls south-west of the camp.
complete A New Cloak's Sheen | Iridescent Sprite Darter Wings from Sprite Darters by the gnoll camp.
turnin War on the Woodpaw
accept Alpha Strike
turnin A New Cloak's Sheen | Krueg Skullsplitter.
accept 2974 A Grim Discovery
complete Alpha Strike | Woodpaw Alphas in the same gnoll camps.
turnin Alpha Strike | Hadoken Swiftstrider.
accept Woodpaw Investigation
turnin Woodpaw Investigation | The Woodpaw Battle Map on a table in the southern gnoll camp.
accept The Battle Plans
turnin The Battle Plans | Hadoken Swiftstrider.
accept Zukk'ash Infestation
complete Zukk'ash Infestation | Zukk'ash Carapaces from Zukk'ash Stingers at the hive south-east of the camp.
turnin Zukk'ash Infestation
complete 2974 A Grim Discovery | Grimtotem Horns from Grimtotem Raiders north of Camp Mojache.
complete 2975 The Ogres of Feralas | Gordunni Ogres, Ogre Mages and Brutes at the northern ogre camp.
turnin 2974 A Grim Discovery | Krueg Skullsplitter.
turnin 2975 The Ogres of Feralas | Rok Orhan.
accept 2980 The Ogres of Feralas
level 45 | Camp Mojache's harpy and giant quests need level 45. You should be there by now; if not, finish the yetis and ogres below first.
accept Dark Heart | Talo Thornhoof, Camp Mojache.
accept Vengeance on the Northspring
complete The Mark of Quality | Thick Yeti Hides from Feral Scar Yetis in the yeti cave west of the camp.
complete 2980 The Ogres of Feralas | Gordunni Shamans, Warlocks and Maulers at the Gordunni camp, south-west.
accept Zapped Giants | Zorbin Fandazzle on the coast.
accept Fuel for the Zapping
complete Zapped Giants | Use Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker on Wave Striders and Land Walkers.
complete Fuel for the Zapping | Water elementals on the coast.
turnin Zapped Giants
turnin Fuel for the Zapping
complete Vengeance on the Northspring | Northspring harpies in the north-west.
complete Dark Heart | Harpy chieftain at the Northspring nest.
turnin Vengeance on the Northspring | Camp Mojache.
turnin Dark Heart
turnin 2980 The Ogres of Feralas | Rok Orhan.
turnin The Mark of Quality | Jangdor Swiftstrider.
level 46
train
note Fly to Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands (via the Undercity or Tarren Mill).
